Krita Nova 72 - Transform tool: a floating actions bar

While the Transform tool is active, a small bar floats over the canvas, in
the look of the selection actions bar: Flip Horizontally, Flip Vertically,
Rotate 90° counter-clockwise and clockwise (these four in Free Transform
mode), Reset the transform, the transform mode (a menu: Free, Perspective,
Warp, Cage, Liquify, Mesh; the button shows the current one), Cancel and
Apply. It sits at the bottom middle of the canvas; its grip (the dots at its
right end) moves it, and the place is remembered (kritarc
[KisToolTransform] novaTransformBarOffset). Pen, touch and mouse work on it.
(plugins/tools/tool_transform2/kis_transform_actions_bar.*)

